1
00:00:00,093 --> 00:00:02,563
(Leonard:)That's actually good.
Why didn't I think of that?

2
00:00:03,463 --> 00:00:06,163
(Sheldon:)Some people are otters,
some people are rocks.

3
00:00:09,402 --> 00:00:13,232
(Leonard:)I wonder if there's a way
we could give the idea a trial run.

4
00:00:13,707 --> 00:00:19,507
(Howard:)I could call my old middle school, see if
we can talk to some of the female students.

5
00:00:19,679 --> 00:00:22,339
(Leonard:)Great. Try to set up something
for us to go over there.

6
00:00:22,515 --> 00:00:25,415
(Sheldon:)Hold on. While I'm comfortable
speaking about science...

7
00:00:25,585 --> 00:00:29,915
(Sheldon:)...I'm not sure I know how to spark the
interest of school children. Better Google it.

8
00:00:31,258 --> 00:00:32,918
(Howard:)What exactly are you looking up?

9
00:00:33,093 --> 00:00:37,083
"How do I get 12-year-old girls excited?"

10
00:00:37,264 --> 00:00:39,024
- No!
- No!

11
00:00:43,937 --> 00:00:46,427
(Raj:)Thanks again for letting me crash
girl's night.

12
00:00:46,606 --> 00:00:49,436
(Penny:)Are you kidding?
You brought fancy wine and made fondue.

13
00:00:49,609 --> 00:00:51,769
(Penny:)I've slept with guys for less.

14
00:00:56,716 --> 00:00:58,276
It's ajoke.

